s piano teaching as a cover for her true profession, and word soon spreads among the building's dirty old men. The resourceful boys drill a well-concealed hole in the wall between Signorina Luisa's flat and the bedroom of the landlord's son, Marcello Busatti, allowing them a spectacular view of their spectacular neighbor.  Marcello quickly becomes infatuated with Luisa, but is also conflicted regarding her supposed profession. Eventually Luisa learns of Fernando's philandering nature, and after a vigorous misunderstanding, satisfies Marcello's unrequited lust/love."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8lu4fcuolvlNdq6RmJgoD7AgKM8.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cchnH9P8m0cKUnFgwXgziXI4i2B.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":107008,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8lu4fcuolvlNdq6RmJgoD7AgKM8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8lu4fcuolvlNdq6RmJgoD7AgKM8.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8lu4fcuolvlNdq6RmJgoD7AgKM8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8lu4fcuolvlNdq6RmJgoD7AgKM8.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v19tCrPaTXikLrx8E3fwvJgz77u.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v19tCrPaTXikLrx8E3fwvJgz77u.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2dL4pCNC8iRpMjEHoBrUDClfbxt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2dL4pCNC8iRpMjEHoBrUDClfbxt.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/laUTQ4DA4DUdZacyFh2g3bhNWT8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/